   "id": "Electronic_Chip_Package_and_CPO_Technology_for_Modern_AI_Era_s6",
   "locator": "Advanced Packaging Technology, 2.5D section",
   "quote": "TSMC's Chip-on-Wafer-on-Substrate (CoWoS)… Multiple dies with different functions are interconnected by RDLs and TSVs in the silicon interposer, enabling ultra-high-density, high-performance packaging. This is particularly suitable for AI and supercomputing applications."
  },
  {
   "id": "Electronic_Chip_Package_and_CPO_Technology_for_Modern_AI_Era_s7",
   "locator": "Advanced Packaging Technology, 2.5D section",
   "quote": "Samsung's Interposer Cube 4 (I-Cube4) is an advanced 2.5D silicon interposer packaging technology that utilizes stacking to integrate multiple components, such as memory and logic chips, into a compact and high-performance package."
  },
  {
   "id": "Electronic_Chip_Package_and_CPO_Technology_for_Modern_AI_Era_s11",
   "locator": "Advanced Packaging Technology, 2.5D CPO section",
   "quote": "Another example is glass substrate CPO designed by Corning, USA… The PIC is connected to optical fibers by the glass waveguides fabricated with ion exchange (IOX) technology."
  },
  {
   "id": "Electronic_Chip_Package_and_CPO_Technology_for_Modern_AI_Era_s15",
   "locator": "Advanced Packaging Technology, 3D CPO section",
   "quote": "For 3D glass CPO integration, Intel has announced it for the next generation of high-power processors… Intel is on the path to delivering 1 trillion transistors on a package by 2030, and its ongoing innovation in advanced packaging including glass substrates will help achieve this goal."
  }
